{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "5b3c6607fef40cb7c304295c0bf0f9f16363cedde3c26080da5e7723dcfbc0e0", "ja": "って、あわわっ！？　うわ～～～っ！！？", "zh": "呃，啊哇哇！？哇～～～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8952914a39065efaab5189fd71c9e500f44e7a534378aaff7edd6d48382c6fd4", "ja": "うわっ！？", "zh": "哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1006_se", "source_sha256": "e99546276a8265778cc82adc3997facd65dcf0bf03a354f395f505b6aaf0c953", "ja": "ドシーン！！", "zh": "咚！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "68dfa9596eaa67db99d40b6dccd389f53a50ecc21aa37a521b19c9df3298df49", "ja": "あいたたた……ご、ごめんなさい！\nあのっ、大丈夫ですかっ！？", "zh": "好痛好痛……对、对不起！\n那个，你没事吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "40b61774d1dd6a6f0581ab63902572187734b58850ff10593082a963d0e7c181", "ja": "あ、ああ。大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "呃，嗯，我没事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a0aaf81e2fd60c4810ba0c5645bf4e20bce29e12c1f6fe6f8b0d5774d4a8b064", "ja": "（まさか、自転車に乗った女の子が\n突っ込んでくるとは思わなかったけど……）", "zh": "（我还真没想到，\n会有骑着脚踏车的女孩子突然撞上自己……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "57c01a1fe41f9d222ec69fe048942a2e6bef7d49a6c78c4387c40987860a5761", "ja": "あのあの、本当にごめんなさいっ！\n私、ポスターが気になって、よそ見しちゃって……。", "zh": "那个那个，真的很对不起！\n我顾着看那张海报，没好好看路……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1d1d6fc58adc961c6659e1c1c1edc66e7f05f6692d4131fde5d57bf4599bf9d4", "ja": "ポスター？", "zh": "海报？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "2756c2557f8279e49f1d601793f292fbeb53de06c98e4aec3936cd7d85164a53", "ja": "はいっ！\n……あの、アイドルを募集してるんですか？", "zh": "是的！\n……请问，你们在招募偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e85c92435278be4afeb2752fe2929cdd2e924c40097eb412fb590a94a6e3b2db", "ja": "そうだけど……。\nもしかして君、アイドルに興味があるのかな？", "zh": "是这样没错……\n该不会，你对当偶像有兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "ed3eeeabcbebff68fffeb84ca80b779c514dd736b33d9f1433571803ebb34f36", "ja": "興味、あります！　アイドルって、\nなんか、かわいくって、わーって感じですよね！", "zh": "我有兴趣！\n偶像有种很可爱、很棒的感觉对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "8dd6467ed48e873cdf1ab8c2aac4a8213e00674a3ad270db4f9dd26f01c1bf30", "ja": "歌もダンスもキラキラしてて、ピカピカで！\n観てて、元気になっちゃうっていうか……♪", "zh": "唱歌跟跳舞时都闪闪发光、非常耀眼！\n感觉看了就会充满活力呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "711651e45b20e45ff9023c11cd4ea332f0da9d27a3dc2d7a5d34c4383a4e933c", "ja": "（明るくて、面白い子だな。何より、\nいきいきとした笑顔は、アイドルに必要な要素だ……）", "zh": "（真是开朗又有趣的孩子。最重要的是，\n这朝气十足的笑容更是偶像的必备要素……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "352ae4f16c51e8b41fef912d2471ef414e27d1414834370dbe3bf35103bb5b2c", "ja": "えっと、お名前は？", "zh": "那个，你叫什么名字？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "02701401f0dfcfd6c13c79a157f5689f72cdc5514ab2096b71c630e7c86ddeea", "ja": "あっ、私、未来って言います！\n春日未来、14歳です！", "zh": "啊，我叫未来！\n春日未来，今年14岁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "13861daf9b11ba2be58da7ea697ace474a5ae84e4bcc68c0c2bc074e6734ad30", "ja": "未来ちゃんか。\nもしよかったら……。", "zh": "你叫未来啊。\n如果你愿意的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_1020", "source_sha256": "9a18a01fe9da6f9e33549fc4e761c37af116c4b0a57ba7e7000155eba1b3f1b7", "ja": "オーディションに誘う", "zh": "邀请她参加甄选", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1a0d95871c5b6d17f64654eefbcc0899a442f2cd06df423bf44a8d6e59fb277b", "ja": "オーディションを受けてみないか？", "zh": "你要不要参加甄选看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2001_014mir", "source_sha256": "0cfdd7ecb238429ad3ba6eae55158027eda09bbdddfe900c9935267e4af31df4", "ja": "ええっ！？\nお、オーディションって……私が、ですかぁっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？\n你、你说甄选……我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "03d19473f3a1eb8b58025a3ed3268eb5bf4875351cbea40e9c362d114d45923a", "ja": "うん。\n君なら、アイドルになれそうな気がするんだ。", "zh": "嗯。\n我觉得你应该能成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2003_014mir", "source_sha256": "cccc0775d9d715c8410b5e4023d6499809dac52a783397f1e8dab527afd8b226", "ja": "えっと、えっと……\nい、行きます！　絶対行きます！", "zh": "呃，那个……\n我、我要去！我绝对要去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2004_null", "source_sha256": "9c8e4f2b4836a9fa0b2e401d99e279cf9d70e4fdae03297c7735ab6d9e9e0158", "ja": "そして、数日後。\nオーディション当日……", "zh": "而几天后，\n来到甄选当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2005_014mir", "source_sha256": "22bfb96efc77410be17ca915775f884075d09f3fb884fe2d37da8588582d4c8c", "ja": "春日未来、14歳です！　\nアイドルになるために、部活を辞めてきました！", "zh": "我是春日未来，今年14岁 !\n为了当上偶像，我退出了社团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2006_014mir", "source_sha256": "f3c90dcee314f895846d7867514ff8d544300ed81026a8dde2d5a7ffb8bc13dc", "ja": "私、アイドルのこと、まだよくわからないですけど……\nでも、私もキラキラしてみたいです！", "zh": "虽然我对偶像还不是很清楚……\n但我也想试着让自己散发光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2007_014mir", "source_sha256": "9bf90ea0e0dcae7e91c5a316023d9cce1324d3d2fcd5bc94a71fdbc4ede48ed4", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n私を、アイドルにしてくださいっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n请你让我当上偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "4bed93be9f104933650e6d0c0409a9dd289e204b13b2b3feb0edb5bf504063d6", "ja": "（このキラキラした目、そして、この熱意……。\nやっぱり本物だ！）", "zh": "（这双闪闪发光的眼睛，还有这股热情……\n是无庸置疑的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "c787d2b801df3aa8b5c5dff0bac316c2496ed05493fe245af9629e6f8107aaf1", "ja": "よし、合格だ！\nこれから一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "很好，你被录取了！\n今后我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2010_014mir", "source_sha256": "6517be0eaf750ab199fc86d7bdf727cbe64a597867c693b1bc7a4dab776da6cb", "ja": "私、合格ですか！？　やった、やったぁ！\n{$P$}さん、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我被录取了吗！？太棒了，太棒了！\n{$P$}先生，请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_014mir_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "716cf984b16240a6157f3f70d2d51732785b755f04c2498e31a715304b2a7820", "ja": "（明るくて素直ないい子だ……。\n立派に育てて、最高のアイドルにしてみせるぞ！）", "zh": "（真是开朗又率直的好孩子……\n我会把你培养得很出色，让你成为最棒的偶像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
